# MySQL — Hostinger hPanel > Databases (free, included in the plan).
# For local dev: docker compose up -d  →  mysql://ftse:ftse@localhost:3306/ftse
DATABASE_URL=mysql://user:password@localhost:3306/ftse

# Outbound messaging — OPTIONAL. Leads are stored in MySQL first and the panel
# reads them from there, so the portal works with none of these set. A webhook
# adds outbound delivery: an email OTP at publish, and a copy of each lead
# pushed to whatever CRM you point it at (GoHighLevel, n8n, your own endpoint).
# Without it the publish wizard skips email verification instead of issuing a
# code nobody can receive.
#
# The same endpoint also receives operator alerts — {"event":"operator_alert"}
# with kind "new_lead" or "review_submitted" — so a flow can forward "go look"
# to the founder while routing {"event":"lead"} into the CRM. With no webhook
# set there is no alert: /admin badges the review queue and the last 24 h of
# leads, which needs no configuration at all.
LEAD_WEBHOOK_URL=
# Historical alias for LEAD_WEBHOOK_URL; either name works.
GHL_WEBHOOK_URL=
GHL_API_KEY=

# Cloudflare R2 — listing photos. Free tier: 10 GB, zero egress.
R2_ACCOUNT_ID=
R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
R2_BUCKET=flyttatillspanien-images
# Public delivery URL for the bucket. Use the bucket's own public URL
# (https://pub-<hash>.r2.dev) or a custom domain YOU HAVE MAPPED in
# Cloudflare. Do NOT point this at a domain that isn't set up — leaving it
# pointed at an unmapped domain would 404 every photo the day R2 goes live.
# Leave empty until the bucket exists: empty = stored keys pass through
# unchanged, which keeps imported remote-URL photos working.
R2_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=

# Portal contact identity (src/config/contact.ts) — footer, /contacto,
# privacy policy and Organization JSON-LD all read these. Sweden is
# email-first: CONTACT_EMAIL must be set before launch — a Swedish consumer
# portal with no visible email address is not credible. CONTACT_WHATSAPP is
# optional and is the agency-side channel, never the buyer's primary one.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ means Next inlines them at BUILD time — a rebuild is required
# after changing either, not just a restart.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_WHATSAPP=

# ECB EUR/SEK reference rate max age, in days. Past this, formatSek() returns
# null and every SEK line disappears from the site rather than showing a
# stale conversion. Default 7 (see src/lib/format.ts).
FX_MAX_AGE_DAYS=7

# Claude API — listing translations (es -> sv) and editorial guides (batch
# jobs, NEVER the request path). `npm run cron:translate` fills
# listings.title_sv/description_sv; with no key it refuses to run rather than
# writing anything, and the site is unaffected — publishing never calls the
# API, so it cannot be blocked by one being down (src/lib/translate.ts
# explains why there is no publish-time hook).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional: the model cron:translate uses. Defaults to claude-opus-5.
ANTHROPIC_TRANSLATION_MODEL=

# Canonical host (listing detail pages are canonical here only).
# flyttatillspanien.se is the only enabled vertical (see
# src/config/verticals.ts) — do not set this to an unowned domain.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CANONICAL_HOST=flyttatillspanien.se

# Self-service agency/independent-agent sign-up (/registro). Defaults to
# closed (see src/config/site-status.ts) so an unmoderated form isn't a front
# door into /agencia while there is one operator. Invite-based sign-up
# (an existing agency adding a colleague) is unaffected either way. Set to
# "true" when ready to open the marketplace to outside agencies.
NEXT_PUBLIC_AGENCY_SIGNUPS_OPEN=false
